{"id":"42a9b0d597972c95","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-cofibration.md","title":"余笛卡尔箭头与上纤维化","display":"df-cofibration — 余笛卡尔箭头与上纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-cofibration","aliases":["16-df-cofibration","Cofibration","16-cofibration"],"display":"df-cofibration — 余笛卡尔箭头与上纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-functor]]"],"source":"Definition 9.1.1, pp. 510–511 (PDF 530–531)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-cofibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-cofibration</span><span>Cofibration</span><span>16-cofibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cofibration — 余笛卡尔箭头与上纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 9.1.1, pp. 510–511 (PDF 530–531)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span>；函子采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{CoFib}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpCartesian}\">\\(\\mathrm{OpCartesian}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofibration}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OpCartesian}_p(f)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\forall w:X\\to Z)\n(\\forall v:pY\\to pZ)\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl[pw=v\\circ pf\\Rightarrow(\\exists!g:Y\\to Z)\\\n(g\\circ f=w\\land pg=v)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{CoFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u:pX\\to J)\\\\\n&amp; (\\exists Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\exists f:X\\to Y)\\\npY=J\\land pf=u\\land\\mathrm{OpCartesian}_p(f).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofibration}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OpCartesian}_p(f)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\forall w:X\\to Z)\n(\\forall v:pY\\to pZ)\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl[pw=v\\circ pf\\Rightarrow(\\exists!g:Y\\to Z)\\\n(g\\circ f=w\\land pg=v)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{CoFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u:pX\\to J)\\\\\n&amp; (\\exists Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\exists f:X\\to Y)\\\npY=J\\land pf=u\\land\\mathrm{OpCartesian}_p(f).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>上纤维化也称 opfibration；等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(p^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span> 是纤维化。显式保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的源靶，避免泛性质中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,J\">\\(X,Y,J\\)</span> 游离。</li>\n<li>余笛卡尔提升的泛性质与笛卡尔提升方向对偶。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 9.1.1, pp. 510–511 (PDF 530–531)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为函子，$f:X\\to Y$；函子采用 [[16-df-functor]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OpCartesian}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofibration}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OpCartesian}_p(f)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\forall w:X\\to Z)\n(\\forall v:pY\\to pZ)\\\\\n&\\bigl[pw=v\\circ pf\\Rightarrow(\\exists!g:Y\\to Z)\\\n(g\\circ f=w\\land pg=v)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{CoFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\forall J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u:pX\\to J)\\\\\n& (\\exists Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)(\\exists f:X\\to Y)\\\npY=J\\land pf=u\\land\\mathrm{OpCartesian}_p(f).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p^{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,J","display":false}],"bytes":1548,"backlinks":[{"id":"afdf39f5221b4718","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CoFib}$ (上纤维化谓词, see [[16-df-cofibration]])"},{"id":"e13f9ded9320b4a6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CoFib}$ (规范上纤维化谓词, see [[16-df-cofibration]])"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-cofibration|df-cofibration — 余笛卡尔箭头与上纤维化]]"}],"outgoing":["fc49efccd7348d66"]}